"Channel message of each new raffle. Empty, a new raffle gets the standard "
"message, in the language of the user who creates it. {winner} or {gagnant} "
"gives the winner name shown on the draw, {number} or {numéro} the draw "
"number, {raffle} or {tirage} the raffle name, {prize} or {prix} the prize of"
" the draw, {link} or {lien} the prize link when the draw has one. A "
"placeholder without a value disappears, and so do its parentheses when it "
"stands alone in them, such as ({prize})."
